ntrol.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-asks-states-to-go-into-mission-mode-to-curb-stubble-burning-as-farm-fires-rise-in-mp-rajasthan/articleshow/134921556.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/centre-asks-states-to-go-into-mission-mode-to-curb-stubble-burning-as-farm-fires-rise-in-mp-rajasthan/articleshow/134921556.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:30:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921892,imgsize-135586.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Even a 3-time CM is not safe': TMC alleges knife attack bid on Mamata Banerjee]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/even-a-3-time-cm-is-not-safe-tmc-alleges-knife-attack-bid-on-mamata-banerjee/articleshow/134921422.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134921422.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/even-a-3-time-cm-is-not-safe-tmc-alleges-knife-attack-bid-on-mamata-banerjee/articleshow/134921422.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/even-a-3-time-cm-is-not-safe-tmc-alleges-knife-attack-bid-on-mamata-banerjee/articleshow/134921422.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:00:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921874,imgsize-115082.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Omair Ahmad on Love, Loss and the Lingering Spirit of Lucknow]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/omair-ahmad-on-love-loss-and-the-lingering-spirit-of-lucknow/articleshow/134921190.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="ma